{"product_id":"the-fame-game","title":"The Fame Game","description":"\u003cp\u003eIn Hollywood, fame can be found on every corner and behind any door. You just have to know where to look for it. Nineteen-year-old Madison Parker made a name for herself as best frenemy of nice-girl-next-door Jane Roberts on the hot reality show L.A. Candy. Now Madison's ready for her turn in the spotlight and she'll stop at nothing to get it. Sure, she's the star of a new show, but with backstabbing friends and suspicious family members trying to bring her down, Madison has her work cut out for her. Plus, there's a new nice girl in \"reality\" town‰ÛÓaspiring actress Carmen Price, the daughter of Hollywood royalty‰ÛÓand she's a lot more experienced at playing the fame game... When the camera's start rolling, whose star will shine brighter?Filled with characters both familiar and new, Lauren Conrad's series about the highs and lows of being famous delivers Hollywood gossip and drama at every turn.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 140 x 210\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Lauren Conrad\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780062092717\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 320\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45301730934937,"sku":"14RB9780062092717","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/67fcaccb31fdf_The_Fame_Game_Lauren_Conrad.jpg?v=1744653908","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/the-fame-game","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}